oject or task? Do you feel more engaged and motivated when you're working w=
ith certain colleagues or in a specific environment? These signs can indica=
te that you're on the right track.\n\nTo determine whether you can continue=
 in the same job with increased satisfaction, pay attention to the followin=
g signs:\n\n* Are you feeling more engaged and motivated on a daily basis?\=
n* Are you able to apply your skills and talents in meaningful ways?\n* Are=
 you feeling challenged and supported in your role?\n* Are you able to see =
a clear path for growth and development?\n* Are you feeling valued and resp=
ected by your colleagues and supervisors?\n\nIf you're seeing positive chan=
ges in these areas, it may be possible to continue in your current job with=
