you're feeling consistently unhappy or unfulfilled, it may be time to consi=
der looking elsewhere.\n\nUltimately, the key is to approach the process wi=
th an open mind and a willingness to explore different possibilities. By do=
ing so, you can make an informed decision about whether to stay in your cur=
rent job or seek new opportunities.&quot;,&quot;role&quot;:&quot;assistant&=
