raits than simply telling the reader about it. Here are some ways to show a=
 character's fatal flaw:\n\nTo show a character's fear of failure, for exam=
ple, you could depict them:\n\nHesitating or procrastinating when faced wit=
h a challenging task or decision. They might spend too much time researchin=
g, planning, or seeking input from others, in an attempt to mitigate the ri=
sk of failure.\n\nOverpreparing or overrehearsing for a situation, trying t=
o anticipate every possible outcome and prepare for every contingency. This=
 could be shown through their notes, lists, or elaborate plans.\n\nAvoiding=
 situations or opportunities that carry a risk of failure, even if it means=
 missing out on potential rewards or growth. This could be shown through th=
